		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Triple-eyed, green bipedal frog-giant with four tendril arms and a gulping bite.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +5 (2d6 + swallow) and 2 tendril (near) +5 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Strange Biology</strong>. Slowed by electricity, but immune to lightning damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a bite attack roll of 19-20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round. Froghemoth regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 20 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
